# pip-audit ignore list, read by scripts/pip_audit_ignores.py.
#
# One entry per line, whitespace-separated:
#
#   VULN-ID  EXPIRES(YYYY-MM-DD)  REASON...
#
# Example:
#   GHSA-xxxx-yyyy-zzzz  2026-09-01  no fixed release yet; tracking upstream #123
#
# Entries expire: past the date, the vulnerability fails CI again.
# Never ignore without an expiry and a reason.
